[b]HD Snapshot - 1.0.0[/b]
High-definition box selection and panoramic screenshot capture for Kingdom Inc workshop flows.

[b]Features[/b]
[list]
[*]Box selection tool to capture any workshop area or the entire factory in crystal-clear high definition.[/*]
[*]Emulates 1:1 native close-up zoom (and 2x Ultra-HD supersampling) with crisp TextMeshPro text and point-filtered font rendering.[/*]
[*]Offscreen tiled capture eliminates GPU texture size limits and prevents VRAM exhaustion.[/*]
[*]Direct export to the game's [i]Screenshots/[/i] directory in full-resolution PNG format.[/*]
[*]Automatic Windows clipboard copy (both image bitmap and file path) for instant pasting into Discord, Reddit, or image editors.[/*]
[*]Seamless Foundation ModConfig integration for resolution scale, background styles (Workshop Grid, Transparent PNG, Dark Slate), auto-open folder, and hotkey rebinding.[/*]
[/list]

[b]Requirements[/b]
Kingdom Inc for Windows x64 (Mono).
BepInEx 5 (5.4.21 or later, Windows x64 Mono):
https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx/releases/tag/v5.4.23.6
Foundation (0.5.0 or later, optional but recommended for in-game mod settings):
https://www.nexusmods.com/kingdominc/mods/18

[b]Installation[/b]
1. Install BepInEx 5 (and optionally Foundation).
2. Close Kingdom Inc if it is running.
3. Extract the release ZIP into your game directory so [i]HDSnapshot.dll[/i] is located at [i]BepInEx/plugins/HDSnapshot/HDSnapshot.dll[/i].
4. Launch Kingdom Inc and open any workshop flow diagram. The camera icon will appear in your edit hotbar.

[b]Usage[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Activate Tool[/b]: Click the camera icon in the edit hotbar or press [b]F9[/b].[/*]
[*][b]Box Select[/b]: Left-click and drag across any area of your workshop. A live dimensions badge displays pixel size and dimensions.[/*]
[*][b]Capture All[/b]: Press [b]Space[/b] or [b]Enter[/b] while the tool is active to automatically frame and capture your entire factory with clean margins.[/*]
[*][b]Cancel[/b]: Press [b]Escape[/b] or [b]Right-Click[/b] to cancel selection.[/*]
[/list]

[b]Configuration[/b]
Open [b]Options → Mod Settings → HD Snapshot[/b] (requires Foundation):
[list]
[*][b]Resolution Scale[/b]: Choose between 1.0x (Native 1:1 HD), 1.5x (Super HD), and 2.0x (Ultra HD supersampling).[/*]
[*][b]Background Style[/b]: Choose Workshop Grid, Transparent PNG (great for Discord & wikis), or Dark Slate.[/*]
[*][b]Open Folder After Capture[/b]: Automatically reveal the PNG in Windows Explorer.[/*]
[*][b]Copy to Clipboard[/b]: Copy the raw bitmap and file path directly to the Windows clipboard.[/*]
[/list]

[b]Compatibility and known issues[/b]
Client-side visual capture tool. Does not modify player save data or game logic. Safe to install or remove at any time without affecting existing saves. Tested on Windows 10/11 x64.

[b]Removal[/b]
Close Kingdom Inc and delete the [i]BepInEx/plugins/HDSnapshot[/i] folder.

[b]Changes in 1.0.0[/b]
Initial release:
[list]
[*]Box selection tool with live pixel dimension readout.[/*]
[*]Full-fidelity 1:1 and 2x offscreen tiled capture engine.[/*]
[*]Automated PNG export to [i]Screenshots/[/i] folder.[/*]
[*]Windows clipboard bitmap and path copy.[/*]
[*]Workshop Grid, Transparent PNG, and Dark Slate background options.[/*]
[*]Foundation ModConfig and hotbar integration.[/*]
[/list]

